<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34271" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπειρ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>experienced</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλιεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					532b20
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, ἔχειν τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>GA</u>
					742a17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				243
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐμπειρικοί</span>
			<i>the Empiric school of physicians</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cels.
				1
			</span></i>
            <u>Praef.</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Sect.Intr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.327
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή</span> their
			doctrine,= Lat. <i>empirice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				29.5
			</span></i>; in full, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. αἵρεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἱστορία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.93S.
				</span></i>
			
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			<i>empirically</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰατρεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					8.204
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.8
			</span></i>.</div>
